From 324f4c98aa1e94379576184f9d3ab1d1724e8623 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Weidong Sun <sunweidong@linux.alibaba.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 15:25:08 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] node: preserve CSI filesystem mount properties

Forward filesystem type, readonly access, mount flags and fsGroup through
upstream mountInfo fields. Advertise VOLUME_MOUNT_GROUP so kubelet passes
the requested group. Copy volume context before adding cloud identity
fields, preserving upstream metadata passthrough without modifying the
request.

This feature applies to ordinary volumes and requires no versioned schema
or confidential workspace policy.

Signed-off-by: Weidong Sun <sunweidong@linux.alibaba.com>
Co-authored-by: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
---
 pkg/driver/directvolume.go          |  79 ++++++++++++++
 pkg/driver/mount_properties_test.go | 164 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 pkg/driver/nodeserver.go            |  57 +++++++---
 pkg/driver/nodeserver_test.go       |  19 ++++
 4 files changed, 304 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)
